    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, it's not just \"exhaustion.\" it's that i don't think i can ever be a part of the world again. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person, i just see the damage i did. it feels like every second i'm still here, i'm just taking up space that could be used for something good. i'm just a net negative to everyone.",
